{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4151160/extras/603621897ac37c38a69b5f39ea54ed90.avif?t=1762279877\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4151160/extras_big/603621897ac37c38a69b5f39ea54ed90.webp?t=1762279877 width=1560 height=911 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beak the hunter is a 2D monster hunting game that follows the adventures of master hunter, Beak, and the animal exploration team while exploring a new and exciting world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare yourself for hard battles against powerful and wild beasts in this soulslike adventure that will test your abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>.Fight your way through 44 different missions with 20 different monsters!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>.High difficulty missions will test your courage as you progress the game in a soulslike challenge!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>.Customize your build for different types of fighting, ranging from spells to different weapons!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>.Explore a new and exciting open world full with wildlife and flora!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>.And explore many other things while playing, like special meals for Beak or new music tracks for your radio or for the game areas!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4151160?t=1762279877","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4151160/a784793fae2b238055c5fbefb0a4c0c3754e74ee/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762279877","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4151160/4570ca4b494ab4f2565ca433b9f05ebb1529fd3d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762279877","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamst